    "section_faq_wxrwia": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_kRW3px": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "How do I work out the right size for my setup?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Caravan beds can be a little tricky — unlike domestic beds, there’s no standard sizing across caravan makes and models. That’s why we always recommend measuring your mattress rather than relying on whether it’s called a Queen, Double or Single.</p><p>Measure the <strong>width and length of your mattress in millimetres</strong>, including any head-end bolster in the total length, and take note of the corner profile at the foot end of your mattress.</p><p>You can then enter your measurements into our <a href=\"/pages/find-your-fit\" title=\"/pages/find-your-fit\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sizing</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Calculator</strong></span></a> to find your best Wanderluxe™ fit.</p><p>Still unsure? Send your measurements through to our Australian Customer Care team via our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"/pages/contact\"><strong>Contact Us</strong></a> form and we’ll be happy to help.micals linked to cancer or reproductive harm.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_EPVDAc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you offer custom sizing?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>At this stage, we don’t manufacture one-off custom sizes. Instead, we’ve developed the Wanderluxe™ range in a wide variety of shapes, sizes and corner profiles to suit many of the caravan bed configurations found across Australia.</p><p>Your topper also doesn’t need to be an exact millimetre-for-millimetre match to your mattress. In many cases, a slightly smaller topper is preferable to one that overhangs your mattress or interferes with surrounding cabinetry.</p><p>Rounded-corner toppers can also work well on square and many cut-corner mattresses.</p><p>If your mattress is angled, varies in width or has an unusual shape, enter your measurements into our <a href=\"/pages/find-your-fit\" title=\"/pages/find-your-fit\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sizing Calculator</strong></span></a> or contact our Customer Care team and we’ll help you find the best fit.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_4xEzb8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "What does it feel like, and where can I try one?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>The Wanderluxe™ Mattress Topper has a <strong>medium-soft feel</strong>, adding a plush layer of cushioning while still gently supporting and conforming to your body.</p><p>Made from <strong>50mm gel-infused memory foam</strong>, it is designed to soften the feel of a firm caravan mattress, help relieve pressure and create a more comfortable sleeping surface without feeling overly soft or unstable.</p><p>If you’d like to see and feel one in person before buying, you can visit us at selected caravan and camping shows throughout Australia or check our Stockists page to find a participating retailer near you.</p><p>For upcoming events, head on over to our <a href=\"/pages/exhibitions-shows\" title=\"Exhibitions & Shows\"><strong>Exhibitions</strong></a> page.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_BCc6AN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I have my order delivered while I’m on the road?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Absolutely! We know many of our customers are travelling, so we use Australia Post for all Dreamer RV deliveries, giving you plenty of flexibility while you’re on the road.</p><p>If you don’t have a fixed delivery address, <a href=\"https://auspost.com.au/personal/receiving/parcel-deliveries/parcel-collect\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Australia Post Parcel Collect</strong></span></a> is a great option. Simply choose a participating Post Office through your MyPost account and have your order sent there ready for collection.</p><p>We recommend choosing a location far enough ahead in your itinerary to allow time for dispatch and delivery. Just make sure you’ll be in the area long enough to collect your parcel once it arrives.</p><p>In-stock orders are generally dispatched from our Sydney warehouse within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>, with dispatch extending to <strong>3–4 business days during peak periods</strong>. You can also enter your postcode at checkout to view an estimated delivery timeframe before placing your order.</p><p>For full details, head on over to our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\" title=\"Shipping Policy\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Shipping Information</strong></span></a> page.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_FCtakw": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Can I have one delivered while I’m on the road?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Absolutely! We know many of our customers are travelling, so we use Australia Post for all Dreamer RV deliveries, giving you plenty of options while you’re on the road. If you don’t have a fixed delivery address, Australia Post Parcel Collect can be a great option. Simply choose a participating Post Office or Parcel Locker through your MyPost account and have your order delivered there ready for collection. Just make sure you’ll be in the area long enough for your parcel to arrive before choosing your collection location.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "text_DVfYxd": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "faq_question": "Do you offer custom sizing?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>At this stage, we don’t manufacture one-off custom sizes. Instead, we’ve developed our Wanderluxe™ range in a wide variety of shapes and sizes to suit many of the caravan bed configurations found across Australia. Your topper also doesn’t need to be an exact millimetre-for-millimetre match to your mattress to provide a great fit. In many cases, a slightly smaller topper is preferable to one that overhangs your mattress or interferes with surrounding cabinetry. Pop your measurements into our Sizing Calculator, or send them to our Customer Care team if you’d like a hand finding the closest fit.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        }
      },
